@startuml Automated_PDF_Report_Parsing_Information_Flow
scale 2
start

#lightblue:Upload a PDF Report 
file to a **Shared Google Drive**;

#lightblue:Provide the user email 
as well the annotation to 
tables or plain text to extract from PDF 
(**page numbers, boundaries**);

:Copy the PDF Document file
to the GCP bucket;

#palegreen:Identify the PDF Document;

if (LEI and Company Name detected?) then
  #pink:fire error;
  kill
endif

#palegreen:Extract the tabular 
or/and text data from PDF;

if (Target data extractred?) then
  #pink:fire error;
  kill
endif

:Find target attributes and values 
(EBITDA, Revenue/Income etc. as configured);

if (Target attributes is found?) then (yes)
    :Save __target attributes__ 
    to BigQuery DB;
    :Save __file parsing results__ 
    to BigQuery DB;
else (no)
    :Save __file parsing results__ 
    to BigQuery DB;
endif

:Send the email notification
with parsing results to the user;

stop
@enduml